      3
      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_ROYAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3
      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3
      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_RICH_HITS_JACKPOT
    value: <style=title><size=42>RICH HITS JACKPOT</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_HOT_RUSH_BONUS
    value: <size=24>There are 5 levels of progressives which are awarded for Hot
      Rush symbols.<br>Progressives are only available at Max Bet and may be won
      during Base Games or Free Games.<br>Wins that occur when playing below Max
      Bet will pay according to the paytable.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_HOT_BONUS
    value: '<size=24>3 Scattered Hot Bonus symbols triggers the Hot Bonus matcher
      board.

      The matcher board presents 20 cards that can reveal any of these
      items.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_HOT_BONUS1
    value: <style=coinColor>20 / 15 / 10 / 8 / 5 Free Spins, +2x / +1x Multiplier,
      Wild + 3 Free Spins, Wild</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_HOT_RUSH_PAY
    value: "<size=28>Any <style=coinColor>9+</style> Scattered HOT RUSH pays <style=coinColor>500x
      Total Bet</style><size=38> \n </style><size=28>Any <style=coinColor>8</style>
      Scattered HOT RUSH pays <style=coinColor>400x Total Bet</style><size=38> \n</style><size=28>Any
      <style=coinColor>7</style> Scattered HOT RUSH pays <style=coinColor>300x Total
      Bet</style><size=38> \n </style><size=28>Any <style=coinColor>6</style> Scattered
      HOT RUSH pays <style=coinColor>200x Total Bet</style><size=38> \n </style><size=28>Any
      <style=coinColor>5</style> Scattered HOT RUSH pays <style=coinColor>100x Total
      Bet</style><size=38> \n </style><size=28>Any <style=coinColor>4</style> Scattered
      HOT RUSH pays <style=coinColor>50x Total Bet</style><size=38> \n </style><size=28>Any
      <style=coinColor>3</style> Scattered HOT RUSH pays <style=coinColor>10x Total
      Bet</style><size=42> \n </size><size=22>5 TO 9 HOT RUSH PAYS ARE PROGRESSIVE
      PAYS</style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_HOT_RUSH_PAY
    value: <style=title><size=42>HOT RUSH PAYS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_HOT_BONUS_RULE
    value: '<size=21>- An accumulation meter displays revealed items.

      <size=8><br></size>-
      3 matching Free Spins symbols are revealed, that items''s number of Free Spins
      will be won.

      <size=8><br></size>- Wild will award one match to all meters.

      <size=8><br></size>-
      <style=coinColor>Wild + 3 Free Spins</style> will award three extra Free Spins
      to each meter and will award one match to all meters.

      <size=8><br></size>-
      If more than one meter is completed at the same time, the highest number of
      Free Spins from the completed meters will be awarded.

      <size=8><br></size>-
      <style=coinColor>+2x Multiplier</style> will increase the Free Spin Multiplier
      by 2x.

      <size=8><br></size>- <style=coinColor>+1x Multiplier</style>
      will increase the Free Spin Multiplier by 1x.

      <size=8><br></size>- Hot
      rush pays are not multiplied during the bonus.</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: "<size=24>- Free Games uses a different set of reels from the reels in
      Base Games.\n<size=12><br></size>- Hot Rush pays are not multiplied during
      Free Games.\n<size=12><br></size>- If 3 Scattered Hot Bonus symbols are received,
      then additional free spins are awarded equal to the initial number of Free
      Games awarded.\n  For instance, if 20 + 3 Free Spins are received to start,
      then 23 additional \n  free spins will be awarded.\n<size=12><br></size>- When
      the Wild symbols spreads, it may become a <style=coinColor>Wild</style> or
      a <style=coinColor>Wild/Hot Rush</style> symbol, which will be Wild and counts
      towards Hot Rush hits.\n<size=12><br></size>- Wilds can't be spread onto existing
      Wild, Hot Rush, or Hot Bonus symbols.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_WILD_SPREAD
    value: <style=title><size=42>WILD SPREAD</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_WILD_SPREAD
    value: <size=24>- When a Wild symbol lands anywhere on the screen, it randomly
      spreads<br>  Wild(s) to adjacent spots, including horizontal, vertical, and
      diagonal.<br><br>- During both Base Games and Free Games, Wilds can't be spread
      onto existing Wild, Hot Rush, or Hot Bonus symbols.
  - key: PAYTABLE_LINE_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>30 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=24>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      -
      After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.

      - Jackpots
      are available for qualifying bets only.'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Red Hot Reels
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: <style=title><size=42>HOT RUSH BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>HOT BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>HOT BONUS RULE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: "<b><size=24>PAYS <style=coinColor>1X TOTAL BET\r</style></size></b>"
